<section class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 py-16">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-6 text-center">How to Download YouTube Playlists</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 text-center mb-10">Last updated: <%= currentYear %></p>

    <div class="prose dark:prose-invert max-w-none">
      <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
        YouTube playlists are a great way to organize tutorials, music mixes, podcasts, and courses. If you want to save a playlist for offline use, you can use a downloader that supports playlist extraction. This guide explains how to do it responsibly.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-8 mb-4">When is downloading a playlist legal?</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">You can download playlists that:</p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
        <li>You created and uploaded yourself.</li>
        <li>Contain only public domain or Creative Commons content.</li>
        <li>The creator has explicitly allowed downloads.</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">Downloading copyrighted playlists without permission is not allowed. YouTube Premium offline viewing is the official option for personal use.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-8 mb-4">How to use the playlist downloader</h2>
      <ol class="list-decimal pl-6 space-y-2 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
        <li>Copy the YouTube playlist URL. It usually ends with <code>&list=PLAYLIST_ID</code>.</li>
        <li>Go to <a href="/playlist" class="text-sky-600 dark:text-sky-400 hover:underline"><%= siteTitle %> Playlist Downloader</a>.</li>
        <li>Paste the URL and click <strong>Load Playlist</strong>.</li>
        <li>Wait while the tool fetches the list of videos.</li>
        <li>Choose a video and click to download it in your preferred format.</li>
      </ol>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-8 mb-4">Tips for large playlists</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
        <li>Download one video at a time to avoid overloading the server.</li>
        <li>Use a stable internet connection.</li>
        <li>Choose lower resolutions for faster downloads and less storage.</li>
        <li>Keep track of which videos you have already saved.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-8 mb-4">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <details class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 p-4">
          <summary class="font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white cursor-pointer">Can I download a full playlist at once?</summary>
          <p class="mt-3 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 text-sm">Tools usually list the videos so you can pick each one. Bulk download depends on the tool's limits.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 p-4">
          <summary class="font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white cursor-pointer">Are private playlists supported?</summary>
          <p class="mt-3 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 text-sm">Private playlists require you to be the owner and may need cookies for access.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 p-4">
          <summary class="font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white cursor-pointer">Is there a limit on playlist size?</summary>
          <p class="mt-3 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 text-sm">Very large playlists may take a long time to load. Some tools limit the number of videos shown.</p>
        </details>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
